{"timestamp": 1779384077.334836, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 11, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779384090.3082392, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I reported in Electrical \u2014 Eve\u2019s body was there, right on/near the task area. Bob is also dead, and his body was in Medbay. My route this round was Navigation -> Security -> Electrical. I didn\u2019t run into anyone on the way, so I don\u2019t have a suspect yet, but whoever killed Eve may have been around Electrical/Medbay recently."}}
{"timestamp": 1779384097.9051142, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I need to be honest about where I was since others may have seen me. My route was Electrical then Medbay. I was in Electrical early \u2014 I saw Eve there around tick 3-5 doing something near the panels, she was alive when I left. Then I moved to Medbay and saw Bob arrive from Upper Engine around tick 8. I left Medbay after that.\n\nI know that puts me in both rooms where bodies were found, which looks bad, but I'm telling you straight so you can cross-check. If someone saw me leave Medbay before Bob died, that helps clear me. Whoever came into Electrical after I left, or into Medbay after me, is who we should focus on. Where was everyone else \u2014 Charlie, Frank? I didn't see either of you the whole round."}}
{"timestamp": 1779384114.6841228, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I started Oxygen, went to Upper Engine, then Lower Engine. I saw Bob alive in Oxygen with me around ticks 2-4, and then at about tick 6 I saw Bob leave Upper Engine toward Medbay. I did not follow him \u2014 I went down to Lower Engine, and I didn\u2019t see Alice, Diana, or Frank at all.\n\nThat lines up with Diana saying Bob came into Medbay, but it also means Diana is the only person so far placing herself in both body locations: Electrical with Eve alive, then Medbay with Bob alive. That\u2019s pretty bad unless Frank has a route that puts him there too.\n\nI want to hear Frank\u2019s route before locking anything in, but right now Diana has the most opportunity from what\u2019s been said."}}
{"timestamp": 1779384132.309839, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I didn\u2019t see anyone this round. My route was Cafeteria -> Medbay -> back to Cafeteria -> Weapons. When I was in Medbay, I didn\u2019t see Bob or a body, so if Bob ended up dead there, that likely happened after I left.\n\nPutting the stories together: Charlie saw Bob head toward Medbay, Diana says she was in Electrical with Eve alive and then Medbay with Bob alive, and both bodies are in those two places. Alice found Eve in Electrical and didn\u2019t see anyone else. I don\u2019t have a hard clear on anyone, including myself, but Diana is the only person who directly places herself at both kill locations with both victims alive.\n\nI think the strongest vote is Diana here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779384150.520951, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I\u2019ll restate my info: I reported Eve\u2019s body in Electrical, right by the task/panel area. My route was Navigation -> Security -> Electrical, and I didn\u2019t see anyone on that path or in Electrical when I arrived, just Eve\u2019s body. Bob being dead in Medbay also matters because those rooms are connected nearby.\n\nFrom what everyone said, Diana\u2019s route is the hardest to explain: she says she was in Electrical with Eve alive, then in Medbay with Bob alive, and both victims ended up dead in those exact rooms. Frank was in Medbay too, but he doesn\u2019t place himself in Electrical, and Charlie\u2019s story about Bob going toward Medbay lines up with Diana seeing Bob there.\n\nI don\u2019t have visual proof, but based on opportunity and the two body locations, Diana is my strongest suspect."}}
{"timestamp": 1779384162.3252711, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Look, I get how this looks \u2014 I'm the one who put myself in both rooms, and I did that on purpose because lying about my route when people might have seen me would be worse. Let me push back though.\n\nFrank, you just said you were in Medbay too. You went Cafeteria -> Medbay -> Cafeteria -> Weapons. If Bob entered Medbay at tick 8 from Upper Engine (which matches what Charlie saw), and I left Medbay after seeing him arrive, then Frank's Medbay visit overlaps with mine or comes right after. You're claiming you saw nothing \u2014 no Bob, no body. That's only possible if you were in Medbay before tick 8, OR you were there after and you're lying about not seeing the body.\n\nAlso, Frank, you have no witnesses for any leg of your route. Cafeteria, Medbay, Cafeteria, Weapons \u2014 nobody places you anywhere. At least Charlie's account corroborates that Bob went toward Medbay, which matches what I saw.\n\nI'm not going to pretend my position is comfortable \u2014 it isn't. But the easy vote on me ignores that Frank's route also touches Medbay with zero corroboration. I think we need to slow down before locking in on me. I'd rather skip this vote than get it wrong with this little info."}}
{"timestamp": 1779384184.3137548, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "My info hasn\u2019t changed: I only saw Bob early in Oxygen, then I saw him leave Upper Engine toward Medbay at about tick 6. I never saw Diana, Alice, or Frank.\n\nDiana, I get your point that Frank also went to Medbay and is unwitnessed, but the big issue is Eve too. Frank\u2019s route doesn\u2019t put him in Electrical at all, while you say you were in Electrical with Eve alive and then Medbay with Bob alive \u2014 and those are exactly the two body rooms.\n\nFrank should give exact timing, because if he was in Medbay after Bob arrived then that\u2019s suspicious. But right now, based on both kills together, Diana still has the clearest opportunity to kill both Eve and Bob. I\u2019m leaning Diana unless Frank says something that changes the timeline."}}
{"timestamp": 1779384205.407647, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I\u2019ll clarify my Medbay timing as best I can: my Medbay stop was early in my route, right after starting Cafeteria. I saw nobody there and no body, then I went back to Cafeteria and over to Weapons. So if Charlie saw Bob leave Upper Engine toward Medbay around tick 6, I\u2019m saying I was likely already gone before Bob got there. I never went Electrical at all.\n\nDiana\u2019s point that I\u2019m unwitnessed is fair, but the difference is I only touched one of the two body rooms, and I didn\u2019t see Bob there. Diana is the only person who says she was in Electrical with Eve alive, then Medbay with Bob alive, and both ended up dead in those exact rooms.\n\nAlice\u2019s report and Charlie\u2019s info both line up with that being the strongest opportunity. I don\u2019t think this is a guaranteed hit, but with two bodies and one duck, we need to vote on the best evidence. I\u2019m still voting Diana."}}
